00:46:03,720 --> 00:46:07,960
LUAN NIAN

444
00:46:18,800 --> 00:46:22,480
LUAN NIAN

445
00:46:24,480 --> 00:46:26,640
Obrigada por estes últimos seis anos.

446
00:46:28,560 --> 00:46:29,920
Tudo de bom.

447
00:46:38,680 --> 00:46:41,840
LUAN NIAN

448
00:46:41,920 --> 00:46:44,320
BLOQUEAR ESTE NÚMERO

449
00:46:56,400 --> 00:46:57,840
