PEQUIM PARA HARBIN

453
00:47:17,320 --> 00:47:18,240
Adeus,

454
00:47:19,520 --> 00:47:20,360
Pequim.

455
00:47:47,880 --> 00:47:49,360
Shang Zhitao.

456
00:47:50,600 --> 00:47:53,360
É tudo de edição limitada?

457
00:47:54,320 --> 00:47:55,960
Nada mal.

458
00:47:56,040 --> 00:47:57,960
